rien. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/38b47e85ec6f92dacd28387aee655694.avif?t=1754579488\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/765041e0e90d5f5eb102051b0a084702.poster.avif?t=1754579488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/765041e0e90d5f5eb102051b0a084702.webm?t=1754579488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/765041e0e90d5f5eb102051b0a084702.mp4?t=1754579488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Edwin is Adrien\u2019s best friend and a fellow marketing major, who is part of an active campus fraternity. He can be very protective of Adrien\u2019s well-being and has walked them home to ensure their safety a number of times. However, Edwin has shown extreme bouts of jealousy when Adrien displays the slightest interest in others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Would a best friend really go to such lengths to &quot;protect&quot; someone they hold so dear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/92965255702a99cdd6c01d4a21ba9f24.poster.avif?t=1754579488\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/92965255702a99cdd6c01d4a21ba9f24.webm?t=1754579488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1404300/extras/92965255702a99cdd6c01d4a21ba9f24.mp4?t=1754579488\